OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand some showers in the evening.
OL,7,FScattered showers continue for
OL,8,FDumfries and Galloway overnight, but
OL,9,Fbecoming dry with clear spells in the
OL,10,Feast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FDry and bright for many in
OL,13,Fthe morning, but a few showers in the
OL,14,Fsouthwest. Cloudier afternoon with
OL,15,Fsome showers before a band of heavy
OL,16,Frain pushes east in evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
