OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,7,FThursday. Showers easing Friday
OL,8,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright,
OL,9,Fbefore a band of rain spreads east
OL,10,Flater. Bright spells and scattered
OL,11,Fshowers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
